      "verbatim_texts": [
        "In the beginning, the process starts with Bill for Purchased Goods/Services and then Receive Invoice."
      ],
      "justification": "Init captures the implicit start; n1 mirrors the 'starts' directive; n2 exactly reproduces the billing and invoice receiving steps."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n3",
        "guard:b1->n4",
        "action:n4"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "If the invoice is incomplete, it is returned."
      ],
      "justification": "Branch and n3 model the condition; guard and n4 capture the return outcome for incomplete invoices."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b1->n6"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "However, if the invoice is complete, the process continues."
      ],
      "justification": "Structural branch and guard implement the path taken when the invoice is complete."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n7"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "If the invoice is non-compliant, further checks are conducted."
      ],
      "justification": "Branch models the compliance decision; n7 restates the non-compliance condition."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b2->n8",
        "action:n8"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
